# Task Manager Application

A Single Page Task Manager Application built using Vanilla JavaScript.

## Features

- Create Task
- Edit Task
- Delete Task
- Search Task
- Local Storage Persistence
- No Page Reload

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- Vanilla JavaScript

## How to Run

1. Open index.html using Live Server.
2. Add, Edit, Delete and Search tasks.
3. Tasks are stored in Local Storage.
